{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-11_beg","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-11","title":"冰原之雪","storyCode":"6-12","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-11_beg.txt","sourceHash":"aa45a42e2c1571fe93df369e95c40f699dcd330b71bc202f8876fdba4dc8e9f3","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"罗德岛和近卫局一步步清剿剩余整合运动的同时，雪怪小队为了确保霜星的安全，舍命面对了强大的雨披部队。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我确认过了，所有能联系上的整合运动队伍已经全部撤出了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"人真多啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"浩浩荡荡的......就像河水一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"荒原上会出现一条河流......一条逃难者的河流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"既有乌萨斯人，也有龙门人。既有感染者，也有普通人。来时他们或贫或富，去时他们两手空空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"原本他们认定有一个地方可以接受自己，现在他们知道自己总归无处可去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"这条河流，最终会从这荒原上消逝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"（他的语气好悲伤。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"（从大爹那学的吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"（也难怪。这个时候了，人难免有些感伤的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"如果大爹在这，我们一定打得赢，也不用走到这个地步吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"运气好坏这种事儿，你再怎么考虑另一种结局都没用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......准备一下。我去和幻影弩手们商量下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"别催我呀，我又不是不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"赶紧去，别墨迹了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我也挺感伤的啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"确定了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是雪怪小队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅他们呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"已经赶赴现场了。阿米娅要我嘱托你，“别冲动”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"这话和没说一样。她知道的......要说冲动，我在罗德岛算得上是第一名了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"煌！你去哪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"去救人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"弩手们！请稍等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"雪怪......等等，你这是做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......霜星大姊她的身体，已经支撑不了多久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"她刚刚为了击退龙门的部队，已经耗尽了气力。可能一时半会儿还醒不过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是要我们再带上她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"可我们本不准备回切尔诺伯格。浮士德也不希望梅菲斯特......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我们恳求你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都希望大姊最后，最后能和爱国者一起度过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然他们的关系现在有点不好，但我们知道的......他们之间的亲情比血还浓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......恳求你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"你们呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我们给你们殿后。如果不给你们拖一段时间，你们很快就会被龙门追上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"等你们和其他人走远了，对龙门没有威胁了，他们也不好再追缉你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"可那样的话，你们就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"只要战斗，就总会战死的。战死在这里，我们都觉得不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星大姊她说的未来，有一点远。但我们其实也不必亲眼看见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"又欠了你们一条命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你们也帮我们带上了大姊。这不算什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们一定完成你们的托付。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"这个，护臂和防护装，你穿上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"这是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊的温度会冷到你受不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......她好轻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"法术掏空了她的身体。轻点，再轻点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"别弄醒她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你看她......看她睡得多熟啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"再见了，大姊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会等你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......就这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......先走一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"是我们先走一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"总会再见面的，雪怪们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"希望这一天来得迟些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要死了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"*乌萨斯粗口*，你怎么就流眼泪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你这样也算雪怪吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你不也在哭？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我哭什么了我！......你忘了大姐怎么说的吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"她说别哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"对！她说别哭......十多年前，她说别哭！别掉眼泪！我们不配......因为我们还没打赢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"等我们赢了，等我们自由了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我们自由了，我们会放声大哭，在荒野里在雪地里，在堆得满满的麦垛里放声大哭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"明明大姊也一边说一边哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"那时她才九岁啊。我们都比她要大好几岁啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"没有大姊，我们已经死在那座矿场了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你带了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"带什么......等等，不是不准带吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"是不准行军的时候喝。但你带身上的，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想喝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"不成，你年龄没到啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"可，可我以前没有喝过啊，我不想味道都没尝过就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"给他一点吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特洛娃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"行啊。喝一点吧。可别喝太多，我们都要匀匀的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟们，都喝一点吧，暖暖身子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"敬大姊和大老爹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队全体","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"敬霜星和爱国者！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你认识这些感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，陈长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但这最后一场战斗必须现在打响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们有得选吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们可能别无选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看看你的身后。现在的他们甚至没有刻意隐藏自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......黑色雨披。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我们必须要和他们战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是我们必须要做的。不这么做，我们就会落下把柄，把特殊部队强行拉来压制雪怪小队的行为也会变得毫无说服力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过，你有没有可能劝服他们投降？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只要他们的身后还有感染者......他们就不会投降。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不会逼你们参与战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，陈长官。但是......但是我们会见证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局英勇坚决地战斗了，没人能否认。你们在为了龙门而战，你们抗击了侵略者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我们帮助你们对抗那些特殊部队的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"而对于我们自己来说......我们要记下每一场感染者的战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"每一场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"战斗结束以后，我们一起去吃个饭吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可，可我是感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用在意。那个声音很大的，个子很高的，这两个人也不会在意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这场战斗......无论是谁都损失太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"对于我们来说是战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"对于龙门来说，这确确实实是一场战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"战争就是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是那个策划了这一切的人，并不在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想，我有必须要告知你们的事情——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——但不是现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，不是现在，陈警官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不想看吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我......."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但就像在切城废城时那样......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"对。我已经下定决心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须要......亲眼去看。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们一起。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"原来叫大姊......不是因为年龄才这么叫？我为什么现在才知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"得了，你必须得这么叫。那年你才三岁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，态度这么差，没两口就醉了？你喊饿的时候，我是少分你面包了还是没把汤匀给你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"这个是这个，那个是......那个！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"说来，有些好笑。我突然在想罗德岛那些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"想他们干嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"那个浑身冒热气的猫，说要和我们一起喝点那只。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"有些遗憾。她看上去量不错，胡闹起来也一定很带劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"但那只小兔子，怎么也没到这个岁数吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"她多大？十六？十七？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"也就十四左右吧。只是逼着自己说些大人会说的话而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"和大姊那时候......一样啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"这最后一点就敬他们吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"祝他们说到做到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"说到做到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，呃......说到做到！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门人理应比他们还要齐心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"快走吧，别看了。雪怪也只能拖一时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不觉得他们的行为很可贵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们没命了，那他们岂不是白干？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"按幻影弩手的说法，切尔诺伯格我们确实是回不去了。我们要往新的据点去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你不关心新据点是哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是哪里，我会和你们一起走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"哎。你们龙门人，和我们也没区别啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"本来还想他们会待你们好一点呢，没想到和乌萨斯差不多一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者在哪都一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚来的时候可不是这么说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人是会变的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"是雪怪吗？那些是雪怪吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"是雪怪！是......是雪怪没错！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"雪怪......雪怪！这群雪怪怎么这么倔？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，可恶！别死！别送死啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"等我过来，我能救你们，我带你们走......带你们走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么像你们这样的感染者也要死在这里？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"特殊部队停止进攻了？不，他们好像撤退了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎......是把主动权交给我们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"这是要凸显下龙门的执法力量？*龙门粗口*，还真是被彻底看低了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，最后一波进攻了。别辜负市民和陈sir的期望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"让他们看看吧，让这些整合运动明白龙门的实力！让所有感染者都再也不敢冒犯龙门！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"幻影弩手们，可别让我们失望啊。一定要把大姊送回老爷子身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......她没多少时间了。最后的时间里和老爷子一起过吧，大姊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我们也没多少时间了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"安排完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"全部都做好了。让我们把这条命还了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"让他们见识一下，由乌萨斯最伟大的战士博卓卡斯替训练，由乌萨斯最冷的梦魇带领的小队，究竟是什么样子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊最后残留的一点源石技艺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"霜冻源石，准备释放！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大熊！我们上了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"雪怪！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近卫局成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]}]}
